sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Administrator
    participant Scheduler as DataQualityScanScheduler
    participant Batch as DataQualityScanBatch
    participant DB as Salesforce DB
    participant Agent as Agentforce Agent
    participant NotifService as NotificationService
    participant Owner as Record Owner
    participant Slack as Slack/Teams/Email
    participant UpdateService as UpdateRecordField

    Admin->>Scheduler: Configure & Schedule Scan
    Scheduler->>Batch: Trigger Batch Job
    Batch->>DB: Query Active Validation Rules
    DB-->>Batch: Return Rules
    Batch->>DB: Query Lead/Account/Opportunity Records
    DB-->>Batch: Return Records
    Batch->>Batch: Evaluate Conditions Against Rules
    Batch->>DB: Create Data_Quality_Issue Records
    DB-->>Batch: Issues Stored
    Batch->>Agent: Invoke detectDataQualityIssues
    Agent->>NotifService: Call notifyRecordOwner
    NotifService->>DB: Update Issue Status to "Notified"
    NotifService->>Slack: Send Notification with Approve/Manual Options
    Slack-->>Owner: Receive Notification
    Owner->>Owner: Review Issue & Suggested Fix
    alt Owner Approves Fix
        Owner->>Agent: Click "Approve Fix"
        Agent->>UpdateService: Call updateRecordField
        UpdateService->>DB: Validate & Update Record Field
        DB-->>UpdateService: Field Updated
        UpdateService->>DB: Update Issue Status to "Fixed"
        UpdateService->>NotifService: Send Confirmation
        NotifService->>Slack: Notify Owner of Completion
    else Owner Handles Manually
        Owner->>Agent: Click "I'll Handle It Manually"
        Agent->>DB: Update Issue Status to "Owner Responded"
        Agent->>Agent: Schedule 24hr Follow-up Verification
    end
    Admin->>DB: View Scan Results & Audit Trail